# ── Clipchamp reference material ────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are *captures of a third-party app*, not our source. The singleFiles/
# HTML dumps are single-page exports of app.clipchamp.com with megabytes of
# inlined base64 images and hashed Fluent class names — Prettier cannot even
# parse them, and reformatting them would destroy their value as byte-exact
# evidence. The .ipynb files are JSON with base64 attachments that must stay
# intact for the notebook to open.
